<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>404 - Page Not Found | ZAiKA</title>
  <style>
    *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif}
    body{
      background:#0a0a0a;
      color:#fff;
      height:100vh;
      display:grid;
      place-items:center;
      text-align:center;
      padding:20px;
    }
    .box{
      max-width:500px;
      background:linear-gradient(145deg,#1e1e1e,#161616);
      border:1px solid #2a2a2a;
      padding:50px 40px;
      border-radius:24px;
      box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }
    .box h1{
      font-size:120px;
      font-weight:900;
      line-height:1;
      color:#ff6b00;
      text-shadow:0 0 40px rgba(255,107,0,0.3);
    }
    .box h2{
      font-size:22px;
      margin:15px 0 10px 0;
      letter-spacing:1px;
    }
    .box p{
      color:#888;
      font-size:14px;
      margin-bottom:30px;
      line-height:1.6;
    }
    .box a{
      display:inline-block;
      background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ff6b00,#ff8a00);
      color:#fff;
      text-decoration:none;
      padding:13px 28px;
      border-radius:12px;
      font-weight:700;
      font-size:14px;
      letter-spacing:1px;
      transition:0.3s;
      box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(255,107,0,0.25);
    }
    .box a:hover{
      transform:translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(255,107,0,0.35);
    }
    .emoji{font-size:40px;margin-bottom:10px}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="box">
    <div class="emoji">🍽️</div>
    <h1>404</h1>
    <h2>Oops! This Plate is Empty</h2>
    <p>The page you are looking for is not on our menu. Maybe the chef removed it.</p>
    <a href="/">GO BACK TO HOME</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>